#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: rozum-meeting-message-list
version: 0.1.0
description: Read-only rozum meeting messages — one Tk source for React and ratatui.
frontend: tui
---
# rozum meeting messages

The first Unified Control Center proof: one framework-neutral Tk view, one
managed fetch, and one refresh event rendered by either React or ratatui.

[env](std/os.ssc)
[signal, fetchUrlSignal, incSignal, fieldColumn](std/ui/primitives.ssc)
[lower](std/ui/lower.ssc)
[defaultTheme](std/ui/theme.ssc)
[vstack, hstack](std/ui/layout.ssc)
[heading, text](std/ui/typography.ssc)
[actionButton](std/ui/input.ssc)
[remoteTable](std/ui/data.ssc)

```scalascript
val apiBase = env("ROZUM_UCC_BASE").getOrElse("http://127.0.0.1:8410")
val refresh = signal("meetingMessageRefresh", 0)
val messages = fetchUrlSignal(
  "meetingMessages",
  apiBase + "/chat/messages?room=rozum",
  refresh
)

val messageTable = remoteTable(
  messages,
  [
    fieldColumn("Time", "time"),
    fieldColumn("Author", "author"),
    fieldColumn("Message", "content")
  ],
  "",
  [],
  "ts"
)

val controls = vstack(gap = 1)(
  heading(1, "rozum meeting messages"),
  text("room: rozum · read only"),
  actionButton(incSignal(refresh), "refresh")
)

def view() = lower(
  hstack(gap = 2)(controls, messageTable),
  defaultTheme
)
```
